<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE - Korea Long Term Credit H1 net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Korea Long Term Credit H1 net down.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			    1,756 vs 1,925</p>
<p>    Net				    80.90 vs 84.48</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		 106.50 vs 124.78</p>
<p>    Operating revenue		 936.10 vs 865.31</p>
<p>Note: Korea Long Term Credit Bank, a private development bank, specialises in loan services for capital investment. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
